 y on the safe side. From the next day the guidebook rule is back.\nCanyo
 n View Park Pond (Utah County): No limit\, all species\nMinersville Rese
 rvoir (Beaver County): 4 trout\, any size\; Minersville Reservoir is ope
 n to underwater spearfishing for all game fish.\nOtter Creek Reservoir (
 Piute County): 16 trout\, any species\; 6 wiper\; Otter Creek Reservoir 
