 r (Sanpete County): No limit\, all species\nVernon Reservoir (Tooele Cou
 nty): 8 trout\, any species\; Vernon Reservoir is open to underwater spe
 arfishing for all game fish.\nNine Mile Reservoir (Sanpete County): 16 t
 rout\nSource: Utah Division of Wildlife Resources\, 2026 Utah Fishing Gu
 idebook and its posted emergency changes. Not legal advice.
